#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_manage_workspace.rst:-1
msgid "Kdenlive Documentation - Title Editor Workspace"
msgstr "Dokumentácia Kdenlive – Title Editor Workspace"

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_manage_workspace.rst:-1
msgid ""
"KDE, Kdenlive, documentation, user manual, video editor, open source, free, "
"learn, easy, titles, title clip, workspace, manage, coordinate, zoom, "
"guides, background"
msgstr ""
"KDE, Kdenlive, documentation, user manual, video editor, open source,free,  "
"learn, easy, titles, title clip, workspace, manage, coordinate,zoom,  "
"guides, background"

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_manage_workspace.rst:0
msgid "Use grid"
msgstr "Použiť mriežku"

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_manage_workspace.rst:0
msgid "Show guides"
msgstr "Zobraziť vodiace čiary"

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_manage_workspace.rst:0
msgid "Fit Zoom"
msgstr "Prispôsobiť priblíženie"

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_manage_workspace.rst:0
msgid "Original Size (1:1)"
msgstr "Pôvodná veľkosť (1:1)"

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_manage_workspace.rst:0
msgid "Zoom slider"
msgstr "Posuvník priblíženia"

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_manage_workspace.rst:0
msgid "Show timeline"
msgstr "Show timeline"

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_manage_workspace.rst:16
msgid "Title Editor Workspace"
msgstr "Pracovná plocha editora titulkov"

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_manage_workspace.rst:19
msgid "Coordinate System"
msgstr "Systém súradníc"

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_manage_workspace.rst:27
msgid "Object position toolbar"
msgstr "Panel nástrojov polohy objektu"

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_manage_workspace.rst:29
msgid ""
"The default coordinate for the origin (0,0) is set to be the top left corner "
"of the canvas and all objects."
msgstr ""
"Predvolená súradnica počiatku (0,0) je nastavená na ľavý horný roh plátna a "
"všetkých objektov."

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_manage_workspace.rst:33
msgid ""
"You can change this by clicking the :guilabel:`X` and :guilabel:`Y` buttons."
msgstr ""
"Toto môžete zmeniť kliknutím na tlačidlá :guilabel:`X` a :guilabel:`Y`."

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_manage_workspace.rst:35
msgid ""
":guilabel:`+X` means the origin of the X-axis is on the left; :guilabel:`-X` "
"means the origin of the X-axis is on the right."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`+X` znamená, že počiatok osi X je vľavo; :guilabel:`-X` znamená, "
"že počiatok osi X je vpravo."

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_manage_workspace.rst:37
msgid ""
":guilabel:`+Y` means the origin of the Y-axis is at the top; :guilabel:`-Y` "
"means the origin of the Y-axis is at the bottom."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`+Y` znamená, že počiatok osi Y je hore; :guilabel:`-Y` znamená, "
"že počiatok osi Y je dole."

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_manage_workspace.rst:39
msgid ""
"Therefore, :guilabel:`+X` and :guilabel:`-Y` sets the origin (0,0) of the "
"coordinate system to the bottom left corner (something we ought to be "
"familiar with from school)."
msgstr ""
"Preto :guilabel:`+X` a :guilabel:`-Y` nastavujú počiatok (0,0) súradnicového "
"systému do ľavého dolného rohu (niečo, čo by nám malo byť zo školy známe)."

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_manage_workspace.rst:42
msgid "This also sets the center for rotation."
msgstr "Toto tiež nastavuje stred otočenia."

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_manage_workspace.rst:46
msgid "Guides, Zoom Level, and Background"
msgstr "Vodítka, úroveň priblíženia a pozadie"

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_manage_workspace.rst:52
msgid "Title editor workspace controls"
msgstr "Ovládacie prvky pracovnej plochy editora titulkov"

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_manage_workspace.rst:54
msgid ""
"You can adjust some aspects of the workspace using the tools in this "
"toolbar. By default, only :guilabel:`Show timeline` is selected."
msgstr ""
"Niektoré aspekty pracovnej plochy môžete upraviť pomocou nástrojov v tomto "
"paneli nástrojov. Predvolene je zvolená iba možnosť :guilabel:`Show "
"timeline`."

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_manage_workspace.rst:56
msgid ""
"If the title clip is in a track above another clip, the content of the clip "
"below the title clip will be shown as the background."
msgstr ""
"Ak sa titulkový klip nachádza na stope nad iným klipom, obsah klipu pod "
"titulkovým klipom sa zobrazí ako pozadie."

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_manage_workspace.rst:58
msgid "Turns on a grid that objects snap to"
msgstr "Zapne mriežku, ku ktorej sa objekty prichytávajú"

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_manage_workspace.rst:60
msgid ""
"Displays a set of guides and turns on the fields for number of vertical "
"lines (default is 3), horizontal lines (default is 2), and the color button "
"(default is red)."
msgstr ""
"Zobrazí sadu vodítok a zapne polia pre počet zvislých čiar (predvolene 3), "
"vodorovných čiar (predvolene 2) a tlačidlo farby (predvolene červená)."

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_manage_workspace.rst:62
msgid ""
"Adjusts the zoom level to fit the standard viewport (or the canvas) to the "
"width of the workspace"
msgstr ""
"Upraví úroveň priblíženia tak, aby štandardný výrez (alebo plátno) "
"zodpovedal šírke pracovnej plochy"

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_manage_workspace.rst:64
msgid ""
"Adjusts the zoom level to display the title full size (depending on project "
"settings)"
msgstr ""
"Upraví úroveň priblíženia na zobrazenie titulku v plnej veľkosti (závisí od "
"nastavení projektu)"

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_manage_workspace.rst:66
msgid ""
"Use the slider to adjust the zoom level. Alternatively, you can enter a zoom "
"level percentage, or use :kbd:`Ctrl+MW` inside the workspace."
msgstr ""
"Na nastavenie úrovne priblíženia použite posuvník. Prípadne môžete zadať "
"percento úrovne priblíženia alebo použiť :kbd:`Ctrl+MW` v pracovnej ploche."

#: ../../titles_and_graphics/titles/title_manage_workspace.rst:68
msgid ""
"When selected, the content of the clip in the timeline below the title clip "
"is displayed. **Timecode**: You can change the timecode or seek when holding "
"the :kbd:`LMB` and dragging left and right (:kbd:`Shift+drag` or :kbd:`MW` "
"for 1 frame, :kbd:`Ctrl+MW` for 5 frames, :kbd:`Ctrl+drag` for fast seek). "
"**If not selected**, the background can be set to :guilabel:`Checkered`, :"
"guilabel:`Black`, or :guilabel:`White`."
msgstr ""
"Po výbere sa zobrazí obsah klipu na časovej osi pod titulkovým klipom. "
"**Časový kód**: Časový kód môžete zmeniť alebo vyhľadávať podržaním :kbd:"
"`LMB` a ťahaním doľava alebo doprava (:kbd:`Shift+drag` alebo :kbd:`MW` o 1 "
"snímok, :kbd:`Ctrl+MW` o 5 snímkov, :kbd:`Ctrl+drag` pre rýchle "
"vyhľadávanie). **Ak nie je zvolené**, pozadie možno nastaviť na :guilabel:"
"`Checkered`, :guilabel:`Black` alebo :guilabel:`White`."

#~ msgid "Show background"
#~ msgstr "Zobraziť pozadie"
